    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imaginytes is a mix of <strong>roguelite</strong>, <strong>tower defense</strong>, and <strong>deckbuilding</strong> set in a vibrant fantasy dreamworld. Explore a realm where imagination comes to life and time adds an exciting twist to every decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the dark forces of nightmares in <strong>beautiful, procedurally generated maps</strong>, ensuring no two battles are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/79be9e75076d0e20697a72dac3485f85.poster.avif?t=1752746193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/79be9e75076d0e20697a72dac3485f85.webm?t=1752746193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/79be9e75076d0e20697a72dac3485f85.mp4?t=1752746193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/281a11fae1c6514b4ae70c8bff83af61.avif?t=1752746193\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon Imaginytes onto the hex grid battlefield to create mazes for the enemies. With more than 150 different Imaginytes to collect, each with their own strengths and abilities, you will not run out of options anytime soon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/0c9c24d7b79e5981f69b08aeeb3779e4.poster.avif?t=1752746193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/0c9c24d7b79e5981f69b08aeeb3779e4.webm?t=1752746193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/0c9c24d7b79e5981f69b08aeeb3779e4.mp4?t=1752746193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/901f317f1522d8b595d636063ade185c.avif?t=1752746193\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of evolving your Imaginytes through their 3 evolution tiers. Each evolution brings stronger powers and\u00a0abilities  to help you overcome the nightmares. Plus, during your dreams you will find different enchantments, that can alter your Imaginytes in various different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/421e06a338febae56049118bca15b8b0.poster.avif?t=1752746193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/421e06a338febae56049118bca15b8b0.webm?t=1752746193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/421e06a338febae56049118bca15b8b0.mp4?t=1752746193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/0888311cbbfe79aa9b920744da985612.avif?t=1752746193\" data-has-big width=800 height=333 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/09bd93fe22067f978c560054bad59ec6.avif?t=1752746193\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey (Dream), you\u2019ll craft a powerful deck of Imaginyte cards and spell cards. These cards are not just your tools, but your lifeline, each with the potential to be upgraded in countless ways. Can you find the perfect synergy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/3adb4a51dbf57ccd76e1cc64dcbe73b0.poster.avif?t=1752746193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/3adb4a51dbf57ccd76e1cc64dcbe73b0.webm?t=1752746193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/3adb4a51dbf57ccd76e1cc64dcbe73b0.mp4?t=1752746193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/7874f35774843be7f63f7bf377fcc1f5.avif?t=1752746193\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Imaginytes, time is an essential and unique mechanic. Every action, from placing Imaginytes to casting spells, consumes time, and as time advances, new waves of enemies will emerge. Manage your time wisely to stay ahead of the nightmare forces! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/db36bb5875b3058d0872534f9c9813a2.avif?t=1752746193\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the tide of battle by casting spells to buff your Imaginytes or damage your enemies. With a variety of spells at your disposal, the right choice at the right time can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/dfc49f43630a17b43c7d86dbd4f9ba9c.avif?t=1752746193\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/e97fdc8285b7ce414c3483f93ef93855.avif?t=1752746193\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imaginytes aren\u2019t just creatures. They\u2019re part of a grander design. With different Traits like Beast, Bot, Wise, and more, you can craft decks that benefit from these synergies. The more you collect of the same Trait, the more powerful your synergies becomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/a191c2cbe5987469e1bd09d9ff355863.avif?t=1752746193\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top off your synergies with more than 120 different artifacts you will discover during your dreams. Artifacts will provide unique buffs, tailoring your playstyle to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/2b984f05fe5ffc277a45937536d3a8cb.avif?t=1752746193\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you journey through <i>Imaginytes</i>, unlock powerful talents that you can set before each Dream. Talents provide lasting upgrades, helping you tailor your strategies and gain new advantages. With each Dream, you\u2019ll grow stronger, allowing for new strategies and deeper gameplay with every run. And with more than 100+ different talents, you won't run out of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/b8fbe4072875e68d3447c9623a0b5f5b.avif?t=1752746193\" width=800 height=619 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749690/extras/c20ba46472e03230bcd9d6e7073f0ba0.avif?t=1752746193\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Dream is a new adventure. Unlock new Imaginytes, spells, and artifacts with each run, ensuring that no two Dreams are ever the same. The more you play, the more your arsenal grows, keeping the game fresh and exciting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to awaken your imagination, master a unique time mechanic, and embark on a journey through the dreamscapes?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist and prepare to dream big!</strong></p>",
